      "id": "claim_946ab3672d1d4edfb5ebe0ab6132102b",
      "statement": "All character offsets in the cite-right citation model are 0-based and half-open: start is inclusive, end is exclusive. This applies to AnswerSpan, EvidenceSpan, Citation, RetrievalSupport, SourceChunk, and TokenizedText uniformly.",
