      "id": "claim_04861637a9804c0494415b33540a2245",
      "statement": "Chunk rebasing uses NormalizedSource.base_doc_offset: for SourceChunk inputs it is set to item.doc_char_start, converting local passage offsets to absolute positions in the original document; for SourceDocument inputs it is 0 so absolute and local offsets are identical.",
