      "id": "claim_d11ac2a39314468ba80fc2670dc65959",
      "statement": "The central evidence-slicing invariant is: SourceDocument.text[citation.char_start:citation.char_end] == citation.evidence. This is guaranteed by _slice_source_text(), which slices from full_text when available or subtracts base_doc_offset from absolute offsets and slices source.text otherwise.",
